add('Abstract','摘要',f'''Nitrogen fertilization must sustain wheat production while limiting nitrogen surplus and avoiding reliance on depletion of soil nitrogen stocks. Surplus ceilings alone do not resolve this balance, and regional satellite recognizability does not establish whether hidden crop and soil states can be replaced during fertilizer decisions. AgroMAS-Global combines a bilateral nitrogen corridor, a state-conditional paired-tree proxy, an economic selector and an observable-input satellite bridge, evaluated with WOFOST81-SNOMIN across five contrasting regional archetypes. In the adaptive-reused temporal benchmark, joint compliance increased from {JU}% under unilateral control to {J}%, compared with {JP}% for identically masked proximal policy optimization, while the bilateral controller gained {G} EUR per hectare and reduced nitrogen application by {NR}% relative to fixed dosing, yet prior-year satellite probes achieved a pooled mineralization R² of {PRIOR} with within-region R² of {PRIORW} and the satellite bridge recovered none of the compliance gap to full telemetry. Separating balance constraints, native stock accounting and temporal observability provides a practical criterion for testing when satellite priors can support nitrogen management without being mistaken for field-state measurements.''',f'''小麦施氮需要兼顾生产、氮盈余约束与土壤氮库存维持。单侧盈余上限无法同时解决这些问题，卫星表征能辨认地区也不等于它能在施肥决策中替代不可观测的作物和土壤状态。AgroMAS-Global结合双侧氮走廊、状态条件配对树代理、经济选择器和可观测输入卫星桥接，并在五个对比鲜明的区域类型上利用WOFOST81-SNOMIN开展验证。在自适应复用时间基准中，联合达标率从单侧控制的{JU}%提高至{J}%，同掩码近端策略优化为{JP}%，双侧控制相对固定施肥提高部分收益{G}欧元每公顷、减少施氮{NR}%，但上一年卫星矿化量探针的总体R²为{PRIOR}、地区内部R²为{PRIORW}，卫星桥接没有恢复与完整遥测之间的达标率差距。区分收支约束、原生库存核算与时间可观测性，为检验卫星先验何时能够支持氮管理而不被误当作田间状态测量提供了实际判据。''')
add('1 Introduction','1 引言',r'''Wheat nitrogen management connects food production to changes in water quality, atmospheric emissions and soil fertility. Fertilizer supplies a resource that crops can also obtain from initial soil stocks and organic matter turnover, so a high harvested nitrogen to external input ratio can arise from different physical pathways. Decisions that reduce purchased fertilizer may therefore improve an input-based efficiency indicator while increasing dependence on soil nitrogen withdrawal. The nitrogen use efficiency framework motivates examining output and surplus together rather than treating either high efficiency or low input as sufficient evidence of sustainable management [@zhang2015; @eunep2015]. This distinction matters when a digital controller is rewarded at harvest but the soil stock supporting that harvest is reset before the next simulated season.

Process-based crop research has developed several complementary routes for linking fertilizer decisions to crop growth and soil processes. WOFOST provides a structured description of crop phenology and biomass formation, and its nitrogen extension couples crop nitrogen demand to the organic and mineral soil pools represented in SNOMIN [@dewit2019; @berghuijs2024]. DSSAT, APSIM and CropSyst broaden the treatment of management, weather and soil interactions across cropping systems, allowing fertilizer responses to be assessed within a seasonal production context [@jones2003; @holzworth2014; @stockle2003]. Yield-gap analysis makes the dependence of attainable production on site conditions explicit, while agronomic nitrogen research distinguishes improved uptake from changes in the balance between input and output [@vanittersum2013; @cassman2002]. Spatial soil information contributes regional priors with quantified uncertainty rather than replacing local observations [@poggio2021]. These approaches provide the physical and data foundations needed for decision support, although their different state descriptions and spatial support must be aligned before their outputs can be combined. Constrained reinforcement learning extends this foundation to adaptive fertilizer allocation [@baja2025]. AlphaEarth Foundations supplies a complementary representation of annual surface conditions across multiple satellite data streams [@brown2025].

A common difficulty lies in the relationship between balance constraints and state observability. An upper surplus limit constrains excess external input relative to harvested nitrogen, but it does not impose an upper efficiency limit or account for a hidden decline in the initial soil stock. Adding a bilateral corridor changes the feasible actions, yet those actions are still selected from predictions conditioned on soil and crop states that may be unavailable at deployment. Satellite embeddings can distinguish persistent environmental settings without resolving the year-specific states that determine a fertilizer response. The scientific question is therefore how much of the benefit of bilateral nitrogen control remains when its internal state information is replaced by observable weather, static soil priors and prior-year satellite representations.

An incorrect answer would affect both agronomic and economic decisions. A controller that interprets soil-supported harvest as successful fertilizer reduction can leave the apparent balance and the native stock balance telling different stories. A satellite model that performs well by recognizing regional identity may appear to solve that problem even when it fails to follow local changes between seasons. Combining these two errors would encourage deployment where the information required by the control rule has not been demonstrated. A useful assessment must therefore compare matched control rules, inspect the stock and boundary flows behind their reported indicators, and separate spatial prediction from temporal reconstruction before assigning a deployment role to satellite priors.

AgroMAS-Global addresses this question through a controlled sequence of comparisons. A paired-tree state-conditional proxy supplies a two-tier bilateral corridor guard and an economic action selector, while a matched masked policy provides a learning-based comparator. Native carbon and nitrogen ledgers distinguish crop uptake, published losses and the derived upper-boundary contribution across five wheat-model archetypes. Real AlphaEarth pixels are then tested against physical endpoints using nested year and region holdouts, followed by an observable-input control assay using only prior-year satellite timestamps where available. The resulting evidence links control recovery to its observation requirements and identifies the limits of interpreting a spatially informative embedding as a substitute for internal crop and soil telemetry.''',r'''小麦氮管理把粮食生产与水质、大气排放和土壤肥力联系起来。作物既可利用肥料，也可利用初始土壤库存和有机质周转释放的氮，因此收获氮与外部投入之比升高可以对应不同的物理路径。降低购买肥料的决策可能改善基于外部投入的效率指标，同时增加对土壤氮库存的依赖。氮利用效率框架强调把产出与盈余结合起来考察，不能仅凭高效率或低投入判断可持续性[@zhang2015; @eunep2015]。当数字控制器在收获时获得奖励，而支撑收获的土壤库存又在下一个模拟季开始前重置时，这一区别尤其重要。

过程作物研究通过多种互补路径连接施肥决策、作物生长和土壤过程。WOFOST描述物候与生物量形成，其氮扩展把作物氮需求与SNOMIN表示的有机氮、矿质氮库存相耦合[@dewit2019; @berghuijs2024]。DSSAT、APSIM和CropSyst进一步表示不同种植系统中的管理、气象与土壤相互作用，使肥料响应能够放在整个生长季的生产背景中评价[@jones2003; @holzworth2014; @stockle2003]。产量差分析明确了可达到的生产水平对立地条件的依赖，农艺氮研究则区分吸收改善与投入产出平衡变化[@vanittersum2013; @cassman2002]。空间土壤信息提供带有不确定性的区域先验，并不替代局地观测[@poggio2021]。这些方法共同构成决策支持的物理和数据基础，但在组合输出之前，需要先对应其状态定义和空间尺度。约束强化学习在这一基础上实现自适应施肥分配[@baja2025]。AlphaEarth Foundations则提供对多源卫星年度地表条件的互补表征[@brown2025]。

共同困难在于收支约束与状态可观测性之间的关系。盈余上限限制外部投入相对收获氮的过剩，却不直接规定效率上限，也不计入初始土壤库存的隐性下降。双侧走廊会改变可选行动，但行动仍由土壤和作物状态条件下的预测决定，而这些状态在实际部署时可能无法获得。卫星嵌入可以区分长期存在的环境背景，却未必解析决定肥料响应的逐年状态。因此，核心科学问题是，当内部状态信息被可观测气象、静态土壤先验和上一年卫星表征替代后，双侧氮控制的收益还能保留多少。

错误回答会同时影响农艺和经济决策。如果控制器把土壤库存支撑的收获解释为成功减肥，表观收支与原生库存核算就可能给出不同结论。如果卫星模型主要依靠地区身份获得高分，它也可能看似解决了这个问题，却无法跟踪当地季节之间的变化。两种误判叠加，会在控制规则所需信息尚未得到验证的地区推动部署。因此，有效评价需要比较匹配的控制规则，检查指标背后的库存与边界通量，并在给卫星先验安排部署角色之前区分空间预测和时间重建。

AgroMAS-Global通过一组受控比较回答这一问题。状态条件配对树代理连接两层双侧走廊筛选与经济行动选择器，并以匹配的掩码策略作为学习对照。原生碳氮账区分五类小麦模型中的作物吸收、已发布损失指标和推导的上边界贡献。随后，真实AlphaEarth像元通过嵌套年份与地区留出验证来预测物理端点，并在确有上一年卫星时间戳的样本上开展受限观测控制验证。这些证据把控制改善与其观测要求联系起来，也检验空间信息充分的嵌入能否替代内部作物和土壤遥测。''')
add('2 Methodology','2 方法', '', '')
add('2.1 Bilateral nitrogen control and native stock accounting','2.1 双侧氮控制与原生库存核算',r'''The controlled system is a full-season wheat simulation with three phenological topdressing opportunities. At each opportunity the action belongs to the discrete dose set of 0, 10, 20, 40, 60, 80 and 100 kg N per hectare, subject to a cumulative fertilizer budget of 220 kg N per hectare. Crop phenology, accumulated fertilizer and the available weather history condition the decision, while leaf area, soil moisture and crop nitrogen uptake are supplied by the simulator in the full-telemetry reference. A seven-dose grid at three opportunities yields 343 candidate seasonal plans. These finite plans provide a common physical response surface for comparing policies, not a continuous optimum.

Let external nitrogen input be $I_N$, harvested grain nitrogen be $H_N$ and fertilizer nitrogen be $F_N$. The research indicators are $S_N=I_N-H_N$ and $\mathrm{NUE}=H_N/I_N$, with $I_N$ including fertilizer, seed and the specified deposition term. Initial soil stocks are excluded from this denominator. Joint compliance requires $0.50\leq\mathrm{NUE}\leq0.90$ and $0\leq S_N\leq S_{\mathrm{cap}}$. The primary cap is 40 kg N per hectare. These research thresholds operationalize a bilateral balance criterion informed by the nitrogen efficiency framework, but they do not implement its complete farm-level productivity criteria or a jurisdictional legal standard [@eunep2015]. Partial economic return is grain dry-matter revenue at 200 EUR per tonne minus fertilizer expenditure at 1.5 EUR per kg N, with scenario-specific price multipliers and a compliance subsidy where specified.

Native stock accounting provides a separate physical boundary. Initial profile nitrogen plus native fertilizer and deposition inputs equals final profile nitrogen, crop uptake, lower-boundary and denitrification losses, and net upper-boundary export, up to the residual. The published NLOSSCUM variable includes bottom leaching and denitrification, whereas the upper-boundary contribution is derived from the native profile transport accounting. It is retained as an interface-qualified diagnostic rather than equated with a measured field pollution pathway. Native net mineralization is taken from RNH4MINTT and is distinct from the external nonfertilizer term in the efficiency denominator. Nitrogen and carbon ledger residual tolerances remain respectively below $10^{-10}$ and $10^{-9}$ kg per hectare, without changing stored physical values.''',r'''控制对象为具有三个物候追肥机会的完整小麦生长季模拟。每次可选剂量为0、10、20、40、60、80和100千克氮每公顷，累计化肥预算为220千克氮每公顷。决策依赖作物物候、累计施肥和已有气象历史，完整遥测参考还可获得模拟器给出的叶面积、土壤水分及作物氮吸收。三个机会各七档剂量构成343种候选季节方案。这些有限方案为策略比较提供共同物理响应面，不代表连续最优解。

设外部氮投入为$I_N$，收获籽粒氮为$H_N$，化肥氮为$F_N$。研究指标定义为$S_N=I_N-H_N$与$\mathrm{NUE}=H_N/I_N$，其中$I_N$包含化肥、种子和规定的沉降项，分母不包含初始土壤库存。联合达标要求$0.50\leq\mathrm{NUE}\leq0.90$且$0\leq S_N\leq S_{\mathrm{cap}}$，主情境上限为40千克氮每公顷。这些研究阈值参考氮效率框架构造双侧收支判据，但没有实现完整的农场生产力标准，也不代表某个地区的法律要求[@eunep2015]。部分经济收益按籽粒干物质每吨200欧元收入减去每千克氮1.5欧元肥料成本计算，并在指定情境中施加价格倍数或达标补贴。

原生库存核算采用独立的物理边界。初始土壤剖面氮加原生肥料和沉降输入，等于最终剖面氮、作物吸收、下边界及反硝化损失、净上边界输出与残差之和。已发布的NLOSSCUM变量包含底部淋失和反硝化，上边界贡献则由原生剖面输运核算推导。该项作为具有模型接口边界的诊断保留，不能等同于实测田间污染路径。原生净矿化量来自RNH4MINTT，与效率分母中的非化肥外部输入不同。氮和碳账残差容差分别保持小于每公顷$10^{-10}$和$10^{-9}$千克，不修改存储的物理数值。''')
add('2.2 Cooperative decision modules and satellite state bridge','2.2 协同决策模块与卫星状态桥接',r'''The architecture separates four decision roles so that the physical meaning of each operator remains visible in Figure 1. A climate module summarizes prefix-observed weather and produces a forecast without reading realized future weather. A crop and soil proxy predicts conditional harvest outcomes for each legal candidate dose. An environmental module filters these candidates against the nitrogen corridor, and an economic module ranks the remaining actions using the same explicit objective. The modules are deterministic computational roles, not evidence of an organizational benefit of multi-agent decomposition. A coordinator and a direct selector share the identical objective, so agreement between them verifies interface consistency rather than an independent optimization result.

The outcome proxy uses 64 extremely randomized trees at each stage, combined into 32 disjoint adjacent pairs [@geurts2006]. Pairing preserves yield, grain nitrogen, fertilizer and external nonfertilizer predictions within each member before accounting identities are applied. The resulting distribution is a state-conditional ensemble proxy, not a calibrated posterior or a safety probability. The first tier retains budget-legal actions satisfying the expected efficiency corridor, nonnegative expected surplus and the upper-quartile surplus criterion. If this set is empty, the second tier retains budget-legal actions under the expected surplus cap and applies a corridor-distance penalty. If both sets are empty, an operational zero action is explicitly flagged as predicted infeasible and is never counted as compliant by that flag alone. Realized compliance is calculated from the selected physical trajectory.

AlphaEarth enters through a separate observation bridge rather than as an unverified additional reward. Each annual station signature is the valid-pixel mean of all 64 dequantized channels in a 640 m square window. Fold-local Ridge probes estimate associations with mineralization, harvest and management-feasibility endpoints [@hoerl1970]. For the control assay, weather-only, model-input static-soil and satellite-plus-static imputers reconstruct leaf area, soil moisture, crop nitrogen uptake and withheld soil context before calling the unchanged outcome proxy. The restricted vectors also remove region-identity coordinates. Satellite input uses only the previous observation year, and seasons without that input use the static-soil imputer explicitly. This tests a specific imputation and frozen-controller interface, including its distribution shift, rather than proving that satellite data in general can or cannot recover hidden states.''',r'''架构把决策拆成四种职责，使各算子的物理意义在图1中保持清晰。气候模块汇总截至决策时已观测的天气并生成预报，不读取已经实现的未来天气。作物与土壤代理为每个合法候选剂量预测条件收获结果。环境模块按氮走廊筛选候选，经济模块再用同一显式目标进行排序。这些模块是确定性的计算职责，不能据此证明多智能体拆分具有组织优势。协调器与直接选择器共享完全相同的目标，因此两者一致验证的是接口自洽，而非独立优化结果。

每个阶段的结果代理包含64棵极端随机树，并把相邻树组合为32个不重叠的配对成员[@geurts2006]。每个成员先联合保留产量、籽粒氮、化肥与非化肥外部输入预测，再施加收支恒等关系。得到的分布是状态条件集合代理，不是校准后的后验分布或安全概率。第一层保留符合预算、预期效率走廊、非负预期盈余和盈余上四分位判据的行动。如果集合为空，第二层保留预期盈余低于上限的预算合法行动，并施加偏离走廊的惩罚。如果两层都为空，操作性零剂量会被明确标为预测不可行，不能仅凭该标记计作达标。实际达标率由所选物理轨迹计算。

AlphaEarth通过独立观测桥接接入，不作为未经验证的新奖励项。各年度站点签名是640米方形窗口内全部64个反量化通道的有效像元均值。折内Ridge探针估计其与矿化、收获和管理可行性端点的关联[@hoerl1970]。在控制验证中，纯气象、模型输入静态土壤先验、卫星加静态先验三种补全器先重建叶面积、土壤水分、作物氮吸收和被屏蔽的土壤上下文，再调用未改变的结果代理。受限向量也移除了地区身份坐标。卫星只使用上一观测年的输入，缺失时明确使用静态土壤补全器。因此，这一验证针对具体的补全与冻结控制器接口及其分布变化，不用于证明卫星数据一般能够或不能恢复隐藏状态。''')
add('2.3 Temporal fitting, nested validation and replay governance','2.3 时间拟合、嵌套验证与回放治理',r'''The nitrogen controller was selected using only the 1995–2009 training years. Five outer year folds were used for parameter selection, and every backward continuation fit remained within its outer fitting years. The selected compliance weight and corridor penalty were both 200. Three masked PPO seeds each received 151552 decision steps in a three-decision book environment with the same proxy summaries and action masks, rather than an unequal-information comparison with an unrestricted neural policy [@ppo2017; @mask2020]. Observation normalization and terminal checkpoints were frozen before evaluation. The previously evaluated 52 season records are treated as an Adaptive-Reused Temporal Benchmark, with seven Netherlands public-reused seasons reported separately. The original first-unsealing evidence is retained in the supplementary audit and is not relabeled as a new independent confirmation.

The satellite analysis includes 25 same-year observations in 2017–2021, split into 20 Former-Held-Out and five Netherlands Public-Reused observations, and 45 observations in 2017–2025, split into 40 and five. Prior-year input windows contain 20 observations in 2018–2021, split into 16 and four, and 44 observations in 2018–2026, split into 40 and four. The 25-observation and full 59-observation deployment tables are availability-limited mixtures because their earlier seasons lack satellite input. The 2017–2025 collection was extracted anonymously from the Source Cooperative mirror. Its README advertises those years, whereas the consulted official catalog lists 2017–2024 [@aefcatalog; @aefmirror]. Previous-year input timestamps therefore establish temporal ordering of observations, not historical availability of a retrospectively produced product. Cross-fitted imputer training also uses other calendar years, including future years, and is not a chronological deployment trial.

Nested leave-one-year-out and leave-one-region-out validation separates model selection from evaluation [@cawley2010; @roberts2017]. Standardization and selection among Ridge penalties of 0.1, 1, 10, 100 and 1000 occur within fitting folds. Every target permutation repeats this nested selection. The 5000 within-region permutations test year alignment while retaining regional signatures. Balanced windows also use all 120 permutations of the five regional trajectories, together with a 5000-draw Monte Carlo summary. Exact block p-values retain their finite resolution, and ten-target Holm adjustment is applied within each model, window and validation scheme [@holm1979; @phipson2010]. Anomaly inputs require two earlier annual observations and consequently begin in 2019. The unbalanced 44-observation window has a separate balanced 40-observation sensitivity. Paired control contrasts use 5000 synchronous-year bootstrap draws with equal-region means. Those intervals condition on fitted imputers and do not represent uncertainty from refitting the complete learning pipeline.''',r'''氮控制器只利用1995–2009年训练年份选参。参数选择采用五个外层年份折，每次反向延续拟合均限制在外层拟合年份内。最终达标权重与走廊惩罚均为200。三个掩码PPO种子分别在三决策账簿环境中接受151552个决策步，使用相同代理摘要和行动掩码，而不是与信息不对等的无约束神经策略比较[@ppo2017; @mask2020]。观测归一化和末端检查点在评估前冻结。已评价过的52个季节作为自适应复用时间基准处理，七个荷兰公开复用季节单独报告。首次解封证据保留在补充审计中，不重新标作新的独立确认。

卫星同年分析在2017–2021年包含25个观测，其中20个为原Held-Out、5个为荷兰Public-Reused，在2017–2025年包含45个观测，分别为40个和5个。上一年输入窗口在2018–2021年包含20个观测，分别为16个和4个，在2018–2026年包含44个观测，分别为40个和4个。25观测与完整59观测部署表属于可用性受限的混合方案，因为较早季节没有卫星输入。2017–2025年数据从Source Cooperative镜像匿名提取，其README声明覆盖这些年份，而核阅的官方目录列出2017–2024年[@aefcatalog; @aefmirror]。因此，上一年时间戳只说明观测时间顺序，不代表回溯生产的数据产品在历史当时可用。交叉拟合补全器也使用其他日历年份，包括未来年份，并非按时间顺序开展的部署试验。

嵌套逐年留出和逐地区留出把模型选择与评价分开[@cawley2010; @roberts2017]。标准化和0.1、1、10、100、1000五档Ridge惩罚选择均在拟合折内进行。每次目标置换都会重复嵌套选择。5000次地区内部置换在保留地区签名的同时检验年份对应关系。平衡窗口还穷举五条地区轨迹的全部120种置换，并给出5000次蒙特卡洛汇总。精确地区块p值保留有限分辨率，各模型、窗口和验证方案内采用十目标Holm校正[@holm1979; @phipson2010]。异常量输入至少需要两个更早年度观测，因此从2019年开始。不平衡的44观测窗口另设平衡40观测敏感性分析。控制差异使用5000次同步年份配对自助抽样与地区等权均值，区间条件于已拟合补全器，不代表完整学习流程重新拟合的不确定性。''')
add('3 Cross-regional control performance and physical stress regimes','3 跨区域控制表现与物理压力情境','','')
add('3.1 Regional archetypes and comparison boundaries','3.1 区域类型与比较边界',r'''The benchmark covers Lelystad, Beauce, Wichita, Luancheng and Perth as contrasting model archetypes in Europe, North America, Asia and Australia. They represent five regions on four continents. Historical weather seasons are combined with prescribed crop and soil configurations, rather than validated yield and soil measurements from five commercial farms. The Dutch Former-Held-Out seasons run from 2022–2026, while Dutch seasons in 2015–2021 retain their Public-Reused status. The other regional records provide the earlier overlap required for the satellite analysis. This difference in temporal support is retained in every regional and cohort table.

Table 1 reports the primary historical, no-subsidy comparison over the 52 Former-Held-Out seasons. Regional means are averaged equally, so the five Dutch seasons do not receive a smaller regional weight than the longer regional series. Complete regional, climate, price, cap and subsidy combinations are supplied separately rather than obscuring the primary comparison with a large scenario table. Fixed phenological dosing, calendar dosing and a transferred forest provide interpretable references, while raw and unilateral PPO comparators preserve the earlier evidence trail. The matched bilateral PPO is the relevant comparator for evaluating the added value of the deterministic action selector under shared information and masks.''',r'''基准以Lelystad、Beauce、Wichita、Luancheng和Perth表示欧洲、北美洲、亚洲与澳大利亚的对比模型类型，共五个地区、四个大洲。历史气象季节与规定的作物、土壤配置组合，不等同于五个商业农场的实测产量和土壤验证。荷兰原Held-Out季节为2022–2026年，2015–2021年仍保留Public-Reused身份，其他地区记录提供卫星分析所需的更早重叠年份。这种时间支持差异在所有地区与队列表中保留。

表1给出52个原Held-Out季节在历史气候、无补贴主情境下的比较。先求地区内均值，再对地区等权平均，因此五个荷兰季节不会因系列较短而降低地区权重。完整地区、气候、价格、上限和补贴组合另行提供，不以大情境表遮蔽主比较。固定物候施肥、日历施肥和迁移森林提供可解释参考，原始与单侧PPO保留较早的证据链。在共享信息和掩码条件下，匹配的双侧PPO才是评价确定性行动选择器额外价值的直接对照。''')
add('3.2 Matched comparators and training evidence','3.2 匹配对照与训练证据',r'''The common physical grid prevents a controller from obtaining a different crop response surface simply because its action logic is different. Each selected dose prefix accesses the corresponding stored physical state, and the final outcome is retrieved only after all policy choices are fixed. A requested action that violates the fertilizer budget is excluded before the proxy is evaluated. The matched PPO receives the same conditional candidate information and the same legal mask, while its frozen normalization is used at evaluation. Training repetitions in the finite book do not create additional independent weather seasons.

TRAIN selection reached 29.78% joint compliance across its selection folds, while historical training replay reached 40%. These values measure different quantities and do not replace the temporal benchmark. The ensemble dispersion also remains imperfectly calibrated, so a large fraction of proxy members inside a corridor cannot be read as a field guarantee. The role of the matched comparator is correspondingly narrow. It tests action selection with shared information and constraints, while older weekly policies, fixed dosing and transferred forests provide contextual performance rather than a controlled comparison of identical training cost or hypothesis capacity.''',r'''共同物理网格避免不同控制逻辑获得不同的作物响应面。每个所选剂量前缀只访问相应的已存物理状态，全部策略选择固定之后才读取最终结果。违反化肥预算的请求行动在调用代理前排除。匹配PPO获得相同的条件候选信息和合法掩码，并在评估时使用冻结的归一化。有限账簿中的训练重复不会产生更多独立气象季节。

TRAIN选择折联合达标率为29.78%，历史训练回放为40%，两者度量不同，均不能替代时间基准。集合离散度也未达到完善校准，因此较多代理成员落在走廊内不能理解为田间保证。匹配对照的作用同样有限，它检验共享信息和约束条件下的行动选择。较早的周决策策略、固定施肥和迁移森林提供背景比较，不构成训练成本或假设容量完全相同的控制试验。''')
add('3.3 Recovery from unilateral control and regional contrasts','3.3 单侧控制后的恢复及地区差异',f'''The bilateral controller raised equal-region joint compliance from {JU}% under unilateral control to {J}%, a recovery of 15.21 percentage points, as shown in Figures 2 and 4. Its comparison with matched PPO is less favorable. PPO achieved {JP}% and the bilateral controller differed by −1.69 percentage points, with a synchronous-year bootstrap interval from −7.11 to 4.00 percentage points. This interval does not establish equivalence or superiority. Partial return was {PF} EUR per hectare for the bilateral controller and {PP} EUR per hectare for matched PPO, with a paired difference interval from −12.71 to −0.48 EUR per hectare.

The comparison changes with the reference decision. Relative to fixed phenological dosing, the bilateral controller gained {G} EUR per hectare while reducing nitrogen by {NK} kg per hectare, or {NR}%. Relative to unilateral control, it applied 62.62 kg N per hectare more and earned 74.28 EUR per hectare less. These results identify the cost of restoring the particular efficiency corridor rather than a universal agronomic ranking. Regional contrasts reinforce that boundary. The Dutch bilateral rate was 20%, compared with 26.67% for matched PPO and 40% for the transferred forest. The bilateral rate was 72.73% in Western Australia and 16.67% in Kansas, whereas France and China remained at zero. A global average therefore does not describe a uniformly successful regional control regime.''',f'''如图2和图4所示，双侧控制把地区等权联合达标率从单侧控制的{JU}%提高到{J}%，恢复15.21个百分点。与匹配PPO相比则不占优，PPO为{JP}%，双侧控制低1.69个百分点，同步年份自助区间为−7.11至4.00个百分点。这一区间不能证明等效或优越。双侧控制的部分收益为每公顷{PF}欧元，匹配PPO为{PP}欧元，配对差异区间为每公顷−12.71至−0.48欧元。

参考决策改变后，比较结论也改变。双侧控制相对固定物候施肥增加每公顷{G}欧元部分收益，减少{NK}千克氮每公顷，即{NR}%。但相对单侧控制，它多施氮62.62千克每公顷、部分收益少74.28欧元每公顷。这些结果识别的是恢复特定效率走廊的成本，不是普遍农艺排名。地区差异进一步限定了这一判断，荷兰双侧控制达标率为20%，匹配PPO为26.67%，迁移森林为40%。双侧控制在西澳为72.73%，在堪萨斯为16.67%，法国和中国仍为零。因此，全局均值不代表各地区均形成了成功控制方案。''')
add('3.4 Non-additive ablations and economic trade-offs','3.4 非加和消融与经济权衡',r'''Component removal does not produce a monotonic hierarchy of worsening performance. Removing economic ranking raised joint compliance to 25.06%, while removing the core-state module left the macro joint rate unchanged. Removing the soil-mining guard reduced the rate to 16.27%, and removing the surplus filter gave 20.06%. These configurations refit their own backward continuation models, so their differences include interactions between fitted continuation and action filtering. They cannot be summed as independent contributions, and they do not support a claim that every named module is necessary.

The economic result follows the same distinction. Joint compliance is a constrained balance outcome, while partial profit values grain and fertilizer within a limited accounting boundary. Increasing a penalty can change the trade-off without improving both endpoints. The selected weights were fixed before the reused evaluation, so the observed economic and compliance differences are retained rather than removed by a later parameter search. The outcome is a comparison between control priorities under the specified conditions, not evidence of a universally optimal setting. The full ledger is needed to determine whether a seemingly favorable balance result corresponds to reduced stock withdrawal or merely a changed external-input denominator.''',r'''移除模块并没有产生性能单调恶化的层级。移除经济排序后联合达标率升至25.06%，移除核心状态模块后的全局联合达标率保持不变。移除土壤开采防护后为16.27%，移除盈余筛选后为20.06%。各配置独立重拟合反向延续模型，因此差异包含拟合延续与行动筛选之间的相互作用，不能相加为独立贡献，也不支持每个命名模块均不可缺少的论断。

经济结果遵循同一区别。联合达标是受约束的收支结果，部分利润则在有限核算边界内给籽粒与肥料赋值。提高惩罚可能改变两者权衡，却不必同时改善两项端点。所选权重在复用评估前固定，因此保留实际经济和达标差异，不通过之后再搜参数来消除。结果比较的是指定条件下的控制优先级，并非普遍最优设定。还需要完整氮账来判断表观收支改善对应库存提取减少，还是仅改变了外部投入分母。''')
add('3.5 Climate, policy scenarios and boundary flows','3.5 气候、政策情境与边界通量',r'''Figure 3 examines prescribed warming, fertilizer prices, surplus caps and compliance subsidies. Three climate settings, three stress caps, two price levels and five subsidy levels form 90 combinations per regional season, in addition to the primary historical context. The warming settings are idealized perturbations, not a sampled CMIP6 climate ensemble, and the caps and subsidies are experimental controls rather than enacted policy. The stress fan uses the same three stress-cap populations at every subsidy endpoint. The extra primary cap does not enter that fan or its joint-compliance strip.

Training-selected subsidy rules transferred poorly. Thirteen strict rules and 22 feasible-year rules had training solutions, but only one rule in each group continued to meet its criterion on the reused benchmark. Retuning those rules after seeing the evaluation would answer a different question. Native accounting also changes the interpretation of control recovery. The bilateral controller retained a mean soil nitrogen drawdown of 227.42 kg N per hectare. Its published loss and derived upper-boundary export were 23.03 and 46.60 kg N per hectare, compared with 21.19 and 43.39 under unilateral control. Increased corridor compliance therefore coexisted with higher values of both loss diagnostics. Continuous multi-season stock carryover is required before this seasonal criterion can be interpreted as long-term protection of soil nitrogen.''',r'''图3考察规定的暖化、肥料价格、盈余上限和达标补贴。三个气候设定、三个压力上限、两个价格水平和五个补贴水平在每个地区季节形成90种组合，另有主历史情境。暖化属于理想化扰动，不是抽样的CMIP6气候集合，上限与补贴是实验控制，不是已实施政策。压力扇形图在每个补贴端点使用相同的三个压力上限群体，额外主上限不进入该图或联合达标率附条。

训练选出的补贴规则迁移表现较差。严格规则有13组、可行年份规则有22组在训练中得到解，但两组在复用基准上都只剩一条继续满足相应标准。看到评估后再调规则会回答另一个问题。原生核算也改变了对控制恢复的解释，双侧控制仍有平均227.42千克氮每公顷的土壤库存下降，发布损失与推导上边界输出分别为23.03和46.60千克氮每公顷，单侧控制对应21.19和43.39。因此，走廊达标率提高与两项损失诊断增加同时存在。在把季节判据解释为长期土壤氮保护之前，需要连续多季库存传递。''')
add('4 Satellite decoding and observable-input deployment','4 卫星解码与可观测输入部署','','')
add('4.1 Execution footprint and real-time feasibility','4.1 执行开销与实时可行性',f'''Warm single-decision CPU timing gave a median of {T} ms for cached satellite lookup, Ridge imputation and the frozen proxy selector, compared with {TP} ms for the shared proxy and PPO network. The Ridge imputer contained {PARAM} fitted scalars and the PPO policy {NETPARAM} trainable parameters. This small imputation component does not make the complete controller a smaller model. Its shared three-stage tree proxy contained {NODES} nodes and occupied about 55 MB when serialized. Tree node counts and neural parameter counts describe different representations and are not interchangeable measures of statistical capacity.

The practical contribution of caching is to remove remote satellite extraction from a decision-time call. Satellite download, range decoding and model loading are excluded from the warm latency measurements, and both pipelines were measured with a single CPU thread. The resulting times support millisecond-scale execution for the tested implementation, not a claim of a large end-to-end speed advantage. Stored native integration counts describe the physical cost of constructing a 343-plan response surface, but no directly comparable native wall-time experiment was performed. The execution evidence therefore separates a small satellite lookup and imputation cost from the much larger shared proxy and from unmeasured physical-rollout timing.''',f'''单CPU线程预热后的单决策测量中，缓存卫星查询、Ridge补全和冻结代理选择的中位耗时为{T}毫秒，共享代理加PPO网络为{TP}毫秒。Ridge补全器有{PARAM}个拟合标量，PPO策略有{NETPARAM}个可训练参数。补全部件较小不等于整个控制器更小，共享三阶段树代理含{NODES}个节点，序列化约55MB。树节点数和神经网络参数数属于不同表示，不能直接互换为统计容量指标。

缓存的实际作用是把远程卫星提取移出决策调用。预热延迟不包含卫星下载、字节范围解码和模型载入，两条流程都在单CPU线程下测量。结果支持当前实现的毫秒级执行，不支持很大的端到端加速论断。原生积分步数描述构造343方案响应面的物理计算成本，但没有开展可直接比较的原生墙钟时间试验。因此，执行证据区分了较小的卫星查询和补全开销、较大的共享代理开销，以及尚未实测的物理回放时间。''')
add('4.2 Spatial fingerprints and physical endpoint associations','4.2 空间签名与物理端点关联',f'''All 45 station-year cubes were extracted from real range-addressed GeoTIFF blocks, with companion VRT georeferencing used to verify the reversal from bottom-up storage. Valid 10 m vectors satisfied the registered unit-length bounds after official dequantization. Independent GDAL reads agreed exactly with the standalone extractor at northern and southern sites, and a window crossing four block boundaries also matched. Figure 5a shows persistent regional signatures. Mean within-region interannual cosine ranged from approximately 0.95 to 0.99, whereas cross-region cosine ranged from approximately 0.11 to 0.62. This establishes spatial and interannual consistency of the representation without assigning a physical label to an individual latent channel.

For native net mineralization over the 45-observation same-year window, the satellite-plus-baseline probe achieved pooled LOYO R² of {MIN} and LORO R² of {MINR}, but its within-region-centered LOYO R² was {WITH}. Using prior-year input over 44 observations gave pooled LOYO R² of {PRIOR}, within-region R² of {PRIORW} and LORO R² of {PRIORR}. The large difference between pooled and within-region results identifies regional separation as the main source of apparent predictive strength. Other targets transferred less well, including negative LORO R² for published loss, grain dry mass and corridor width. The year-permutation and block-permutation summaries therefore accompany the effect sizes rather than being used to turn regional recognizability into evidence of year-specific physical reconstruction.

Descriptive standardized loadings and sparse channel correlation groups provide a reproducible account of the fitted probe, but not a physical partition of the embedding space. Orthogonal changes of latent basis preserve embedding geometry while changing the coordinate interpretation, and correlated channels prevent an additive causal attribution. Figure 5d similarly shows spatial dispersion of a fitted linear probe, not measured soil properties. WorldCover identified little or no cropland at several exact station footprints and no qualifying nearby agricultural window for Perth or Wichita under the specified 5 km rule [@worldcover2021]. Soil-parameter source coordinates also differ from the weather station by about 7 km in Beauce, 22 km in Kansas and 47 km in Perth. The satellite and mechanistic labels consequently share a regional archetype, not a guaranteed common field footprint.''',f'''全部45个站点年立方体来自真实GeoTIFF字节范围块，利用配套VRT地理参考验证了自下向上存储的行反转。官方反量化后的有效10米向量满足登记的单位长度范围。南北半球独立GDAL读取均与独立提取器完全一致，跨四个块边界的窗口也一致。图5a显示稳定的地区签名，地区内部年度间平均余弦约为0.95至0.99，跨地区余弦约为0.11至0.62。这说明表示具有空间区分和年度一致性，但没有给单个潜在通道赋予物理标签。

在45观测同年窗口中，卫星加基线对原生净矿化量的总体LOYO R²为{MIN}、LORO R²为{MINR}，地区内部中心化LOYO R²却为{WITH}。44观测上一年输入的总体LOYO R²为{PRIOR}，地区内部R²为{PRIORW}，LORO R²为{PRIORR}。总体与地区内部结果的巨大差异表明，表观预测强度主要来自地区分离。其他目标迁移更弱，发布损失、籽粒干物质与走廊宽度的LORO R²均为负。因此，年份与地区块置换汇总应与效应量一同解释，不能把地区可辨认性转化为逐年物理重建证据。

描述性标准化载荷与稀疏通道相关组提供拟合探针的可复现说明，不代表嵌入空间的物理分区。潜在基底的正交变换保持嵌入几何，却改变坐标解释，通道相关性也阻止了加和因果归因。图5d同样显示拟合线性探针的空间离散，而非实测土壤属性。WorldCover显示，多个精确站点足迹几乎没有耕地，Perth和Wichita在规定5千米规则内也没有合格农业窗口[@worldcover2021]。土壤参数来源坐标与气象站在Beauce约相距7千米、Kansas约22千米、Perth约47千米。因此，卫星和机理标签对应的是区域类型，不保证具有共同田块足迹。''')
add('4.3 Observable-input control and the unrecovered telemetry gap','4.3 可观测输入控制与未恢复的遥测差距',f'''The spatial association did not restore joint compliance when internal telemetry was withheld. In the 44-observation prior-year window, weather-only, static-soil and satellite-plus-static regimes each achieved zero joint compliance under year-grouped cross-fitting. The frozen full-telemetry controller achieved {BCJ}% and PPO {PCJ}% on the same combined window. The satellite bridge produced partial return of {SCP} EUR per hectare and applied {SCN} kg N per hectare, compared with {BCP} EUR per hectare for the full-telemetry controller. Its zero compliance-gap recovery is retained in Figure 5c. Region-grouped imputer results and the narrower 20-observation prior-year window are reported separately in the supplement.

This result evaluates a concrete information interface. The imputer reconstructed hidden quantities from observed phenology, prefix weather and the permitted priors, but the downstream proxy had originally been fitted with full state and regional context. Removing that context creates a distribution shift in addition to state reconstruction error. DVS and stage were also supplied as assumed observable phenology proxies rather than measured field observations. The failure therefore does not identify a universal limit of satellite foundations or an optimal alternative policy. It does show that high pooled endpoint R² is insufficient evidence for replacing telemetry in this controller. The earlier mixed windows retain explicit static-soil fallback for seasons without a prior satellite year, while every result remains linked to the same original cohort roles and native physical ledger.''',f'''空间关联没有在内部遥测被屏蔽后恢复联合达标。在44观测上一年窗口、逐年交叉拟合下，纯气象、静态土壤与卫星加静态先验三种方案的联合达标率均为零。同一组合窗口中，冻结完整遥测控制器为{BCJ}%，PPO为{PCJ}%。卫星桥接的部分收益为每公顷{SCP}欧元，施氮{SCN}千克每公顷，完整遥测控制器的部分收益为{BCP}欧元每公顷。图5c保留零达标差距恢复。逐地区补全器验证和更窄的20观测上一年窗口另列于补充材料。

这一结果评价的是具体信息接口。补全器由可观测物候、截至决策时的天气和允许的先验重建隐藏量，而下游代理原先使用完整状态与地区上下文拟合。移除这些上下文除重建误差外，还引入分布变化。DVS和阶段也只是被假定可观测的物候代理，并非田间实测。因此，失败不能识别卫星基础模型的普遍能力边界，也不能给出最优替代策略，但它说明高总体端点R²不足以作为当前控制器替代遥测的证据。较早混合窗口对没有上一年卫星的季节明确保留静态土壤回退，所有结果均连接到原队列身份和相同原生物理账。''')
add('5 Discussion and conclusions','5 讨论与结论','','')
add('5.1 Physical constraints and observation requirements','5.1 物理约束与观测要求',r'''Reducing purchased nitrogen can appear successful while the crop continues to draw on a soil stock omitted from the efficiency denominator. The bilateral criterion exposes this mismatch by requiring efficiency and surplus to remain within a specified corridor, but improved corridor compliance does not close the native stock balance across successive seasons. The observed recovery over unilateral control and the higher published loss diagnostics can therefore coexist without contradiction. They measure different aspects of the same seasonal trajectory. A controller intended to protect long-term soil resources must connect its operational criterion to the actual stock carried into the next season.

The satellite assay adds an observation requirement to that physical requirement. A representation that preserves regional surface signatures can associate strongly with regional model parameters while carrying insufficient information about deviations within a region. The same distinction explains why a small linear imputer can have high pooled endpoint scores and still fail in a constrained decision loop. Neither adding a bilateral guard nor adding a foundation embedding resolves that state-identification problem automatically. The useful coupling is a testable one in which a proposed prior must improve the relevant temporal state and downstream decisions under the same information boundary.''',r'''减少购买氮肥看似成功时，作物仍可能依靠效率分母未计入的土壤库存。双侧判据通过要求效率和盈余同时位于规定走廊内暴露这一不匹配，但走廊达标率改善并没有闭合连续季节的原生库存平衡。因此，相对单侧控制的达标恢复与发布损失诊断增加可以同时成立而不矛盾，它们度量同一季节轨迹的不同方面。若控制器要保护长期土壤资源，就必须把操作判据与进入下一季的实际库存相连接。

卫星验证在物理要求之外又增加了观测要求。能够保留地区地表签名的表示，可能与地区模型参数高度关联，却不足以识别地区内部偏离。这也解释了小型线性补全器为什么能有高总体端点分数，却在约束决策回路中失败。增加双侧筛选或基础嵌入都不会自动解决状态识别问题。有用的耦合必须可以检验，即在相同信息边界下，所提先验应改善相关时间状态和下游决策。''')
add('5.2 Implications for agricultural decision systems','5.2 对农业决策系统的启示',r'''Nitrogen governance requires indicators that remain interpretable when the source of crop nitrogen changes. An efficiency corridor can be useful for screening external-input balances, while native process ledgers reveal whether an apparent gain involves stock withdrawal or an accounting boundary omitted from the published loss variable. Economic assessment must then state which products and costs are included. The partial return examined here does not include every operating cost, crop rotation effect or environmental externality and cannot be treated as whole-farm profit.

For satellite-assisted systems, the evidence supports separating regional characterization from state replacement. Annual embeddings can supply a reproducible regional representation and a low-cost cached input. Their spatial resolution does not, by itself, establish the resolution of a decoded soil process, especially when station pixels are urban and soil parameters originate elsewhere. Deployment assessment should therefore pair a temporal reconstruction test with an actual control comparison. This prevents an attractive sub-field map or a pooled prediction score from becoming a claim of field-ready nitrogen management.''',r'''当作物氮来源变化时，氮治理仍需要能够解释的指标。效率走廊可用于筛查外部投入收支，原生过程账则揭示表观收益是否涉及库存提取，或是否遗漏了发布损失变量之外的核算边界。经济评价随后需要说明包含哪些产品和成本。本文部分收益没有计入所有运营成本、轮作效应或环境外部性，不能当作整场利润。

对于卫星辅助系统，证据支持把地区表征与状态替代分开。年度嵌入能够提供可复现的地区表示和低成本缓存输入，但空间分辨率本身不证明解码土壤过程具有相同分辨率，尤其当站点像元是城市、土壤参数又来自别处时。因此，部署评价需要把时间重建检验与实际控制比较结合，避免把精细空间图或总体预测分数转化为田间氮管理已可部署的论断。''')
add('5.3 Limits and three next research pathways','5.3 局限与三条后续路径',r'''The evidence is limited by the small number of regional archetypes, reused temporal evaluation, prescribed soil profiles, annual satellite products and the particular Ridge-to-frozen-proxy interface. The permutation reference distributions additionally assume exchangeability of years within regions or aligned trajectories across regions, and do not establish a causal satellite effect conditional on climate. The original pretraining source record for the matched PPO did not cover every supporting module, so its later source provenance remains supplementary rather than a retroactive claim about unlogged execution. These limits constrain the scope of the comparison and are not removed by the number of correlated pixels extracted around a station.

Three extensions follow directly. Continuous multi-season runs should carry soil organic matter and mineral stocks forward so that the control criterion is tested against accumulated depletion. Co-located sub-parcel field trials should combine measured nitrogen and water states with time-resolved satellite inputs, including uncertainty and realistic errors in observable phenology. Spatially explicit climate ensembles should then evaluate policies across genuinely independent environmental settings rather than only idealized warming levels. Within the present evidence, bilateral filtering improves the selected balance criterion over unilateral control, matched PPO remains competitive, and the tested satellite bridge does not replace the telemetry required for joint compliance.''',r'''证据受到地区类型数量较少、复用时间评价、规定土壤剖面、年度卫星产品以及特定Ridge到冻结代理接口的限制。置换参考分布还假定地区内部年份或跨地区对齐轨迹可交换，不建立控制气候后的卫星因果效应。匹配PPO最初的预训练源码记录没有覆盖全部支持模块，因此后来的来源佐证仍属于补充证据，不能追溯证明未记录的执行。这些限制不会因站点周围提取了更多相关像元而消失。

后续有三条直接路径。连续多季模拟应把有机质和矿质库存传到下一季，以累计耗竭检验控制判据。同址小田块试验应把氮、水实测状态与时间分辨卫星输入结合，并纳入不确定性和可观测物候的真实误差。随后采用空间显式气候集合，在真正独立的环境设置中评价策略，而不只使用理想化暖化水平。在当前证据内，双侧筛选相对单侧控制改善了规定收支判据，匹配PPO仍具竞争力，所测卫星桥接没有替代联合达标所需的遥测。''')
